        "created_at": "2016-08-19T17:38:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Someone asked this after the unboxing video and it doesn't work <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/fv-tachyon-and-pl626-compound-xi-9199\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/fv-tachyon-and-pl626-compound-xi-9199</a></p>\n<p>MigrantP gave the answer</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>All of the reactions (damage+discard) from PL626 would happen at the end of your string of powers, not in the midst.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
