        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hmmm. Thats a good call. Nobody ever plays against Spite while playtesting...</p><p>Well, infinite combos as a rule of thumb are not allowed. Treat it as Blitz only being a singular use of the power that repeats its effect if the conditional phrase is met. That will sure-up this interaction and keep the power working as intended.</p><p>Nice catch. I&#39;m sure this will be errata&#39;ed in the video game.</p><p>Edit: Nvm its already fixed in the video game!</p>",
