        "raw": "<p>Blitz:</p><blockquote><p>If you do, use this power again now.</p></blockquote><p>PL626</p><blockquote><p>Whenever a hero uses a power,</p></blockquote><p>So if you used Blitz, then moved a Burst from your trash to the bottom of your deck to use it again, and used it a total of 13 times, each power use would resolve last to first, and Spite would deal you 2 damage, then discard the top 5 cards of your deck 13 times.</p><p>Similarly, if you use Prejudice and then Pride against Spite as Expatriette, he should wait until Pride is finished and then hit you for 2 and discard cards twice.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I assume (but could be wrong) that this also means that if Fanatic put embolden on Tachyon and Tachyon used Burst, putting 1 burst card under to repeat the power (repeating any number of times) she will have used at least 2 powers and be done. &nbsp;But if she uses esearch Grant first then she could use Blitz as many times as her stock of trashed burst cards allows still. &nbsp;Just like Expat and Unload.</span></p>",
